From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 12 Dec 2023 16:59:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 006/913] plat-stm32mp2: embed some extra test facilities

Activate CFG_WERROR and CFG_ENABLE_EMBEDDED_TESTS on stm32mp2 platforms.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 35017d721360bb5bf4f17df17fc2fabe986b8dd3 plat-stm32mp2: embed some extra test facilities]
Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I5944aa886c4595323ed0670deb31182fa83d672e
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
index 748b143f0..e9c9e2112 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
@@ -126,6 +126,7 @@ CFG_SCMI_SERVER_RESET_CONSUMER ?= y
 # Default enable some test facitilites
 CFG_ENABLE_EMBEDDED_TESTS ?= y
 CFG_WITH_STATS ?= y
+CFG_WERROR ?= y
 
 # Default disable ASLR
 CFG_CORE_ASLR ?= n
